OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome brightness possible in the
OL,6,Feast first thing. Otherwise cloud and
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain spread east through
OL,8,Fthe morning, this likely becoming more
OL,9,Fpatchy for a time in the afternoon
OL,10,Fwith some bright spells developing in
OL,11,Fthe north and west.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying cloudy in the east
OL,14,Fwith rain becoming heavier and more
OL,15,Fpersistent through the evening and
OL,16,Fovernight. Dry in the north and west
OL,17,Fat first but showery rain developing
OL,18,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
