OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloud and occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy rain soon clearing the east.
OL,7,FOtherwise bright spells and a few
OL,8,Fshowers, becoming increasingly dry and
OL,9,Fbright through the day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,12,Fstart Thursday with some brightness.
OL,13,FBecoming windy as cloud and rain pass
OL,14,Feast Thursday afternoon and evening.
OL,15,FBright spells and a few showers
OL,16,FFriday. Rain or showers on Saturday.
